      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Let me check the `AnnotationTestUtil` base class too.Now I have a clear picture. I'll improve understandability by:\n- Removing the unused `_set` helper method\n- Adding `@DisplayName` for descriptive test reporting\n- Adding assertion failure messages so any failure is self-explanatory\n- Adding a brief class-level commentThe improved test compiled successfully."
